            {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "element_type": 0,
                  "text_element": {
                    "text": "N13-05 与 N2 Watcher 的边界",
                    "text_style": {
                      "font_size": 13,
                      "font_weight": "bold",
                      "italic": false,
                      "line_through": false,
                      "text_color": "#111827",
                      "underline": false
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "indent": 0,
              "list_begin_index": 0,
              "paragraph_type": 0,
              "quote": false
            },
            {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "element_type": 0,
                  "text_element": {
                    "text": "要点：Watcher 全时多模聆听（N2）是\"永远在线\"；",
                    "text_style": {
                      "font_size": 11,
                      "italic": false,
                      "line_through": false,
                      "text_color": "#374151",
                      "underline": false
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "indent": 0,
              "list_begin_index": 0,
              "paragraph_type": 0,
              "quote": false
            },
            {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "element_type": 0,
                  "text_element": {
                    "text": "本层逐帧链路是\"按需下发的视觉持续任务\"。",
                    "text_style": {
                      "font_size": 11,
                      "italic": false,
                      "line_through": false,
                      "text_color": "#374151",
                      "underline": false
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "indent": 0,
              "list_begin_index": 0,
              "paragraph_type": 0,
              "quote": false
            },
            {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "element_type": 0,
                  "text_element": {
                    "text": "Watcher 触发→可能唤起本链路；本链路不反向触发通话。",
                    "text_style": {
                      "font_size": 11,
                      "italic": false,
                      "line_through": false,
                      "text_color": "#374151",
                      "underline": false
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "indent": 0,
              "list_begin_index": 0,
              "paragraph_type": 0,
              "quote": false
            },
            {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "element_type": 0,
                  "text_element": {
                    "text": "【待核】",
                    "text_style": {
                      "font_size": 10,
                      "italic": false,
                      "line_through": false,
                      "text_color": "#6b7280",
                      "underline": false
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "indent": 0,
              "list_begin_index": 0,
              "paragraph_type": 0,
              "quote": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "text": "N13-05 与 N2 Watcher 的边界\n要点：Watcher 全时多模聆听（N2）是\"永远在线\"；\n本层逐帧链路是\"按需下发的视觉持续任务\"。\nWatcher 触发→可能唤起本链路；本链路不反向触发通话。\n【待核】",
